meta {
  name: Component VaR
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/risk/components
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
}

docs {
  Euler allocation of portfolio VaR onto each position: componentVarUsd sums exactly to varUsd.

  A negative componentVarUsd means the position is REDUCING total risk — a genuine hedge. That
  is precisely the information the old sum-of-absolutes aggregation could not express, since it
  took absolute values and scored a hedge like a doubled-up position.
}
